### List Transactions
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token 1da36eeb020ebf48ab4fe3ac1fccf3d37c5a5374

### List Transactions with Pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/?page=1&page_size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Filter Transactions by Type (Income)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/?type=pemasukan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Filter Transactions by Type (Expense)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/?type=pengeluaran
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Filter Transactions by Category
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/?category=Makanan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Search Transactions
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/?search=makan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Order Transactions by Amount (Descending)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/?ordering=-amount
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Create Transaction (Without Wallet - Uses Default)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token 80a91031da2d51fec1556e412d2b2aa260ef91b7

{
    "date": "2025-12-27",
    "type": "pengeluaran",
    "description": "Makan siang di restoran",
    "category": "Makanan",
    "amount": "50000.00"
}

### Create Income Transaction (Without Wallet - Uses Default)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

{
    "date": "2025-12-27",
    "type": "pemasukan",
    "description": "Gaji bulanan",
    "category": "Gaji",
    "amount": "5000000.00"
}

### Create Transaction (With Specific Wallet)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

{
    "date": "2025-12-27",
    "type": "pengeluaran",
    "description": "Makan siang di restoran",
    "category": "Makanan",
    "amount": "50000.00",
    "wallet_id": 1
}

### Retrieve Transaction by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Partial Update Transaction
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

{
    "amount": "60000.00",
    "description": "Makan siang di restoran biasa"
}

### Delete Transaction
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Get Transaction Summary
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/summary/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>

### Get Transactions by Category
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/transactions/by-category/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>


### List Daily Transactions
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/daily-transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token 1da36eeb020ebf48ab4fe3ac1fccf3d37c5a5374

### List Monthly Transactions
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/monthly-transactions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token <token_from_register_or_login>
